# logaperture-sample-war endpoints — the dev/wildfly deploy target.
#
# Needs the "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client): a "Send Request"
# link appears above each request below. Bring the app up first:
#
#   python3 dev/wildfly/wildflyctl.py up
#   python3 dev/wildfly/wildflyctl.py deploy
#
# The timer logs on a background thread — its output goes to the server,
# not the response body. Watch it with `python3 dev/wildfly/wildflyctl.py tail`.

@base = http://localhost:8080/logaperture-sample-war

### One burst of log lines: TRACE..ERROR via java.util.logging, SLF4J and Log4j.
GET {{base}}/log

### Start the background timer — a burst every 2s.
POST {{base}}/timer/start?periodMs=2000

### Start it faster (min 500ms), replacing any timer already running.
POST {{base}}/timer/start?periodMs=500&restart=true

### Timer state: running?, period, tick count.
GET {{base}}/timer/status

### Stop the timer.
POST {{base}}/timer/stop
